🧩 What is a Set?
A collection of unique elements (no duplicates).

Does not store key-value pairs.

Elements are stored like: [A, B, C]

✅ Example:
java
Copy
Edit
Set<String> fruits = new HashSet<>();
fruits.add("Apple");
fruits.add("Banana");
fruits.add("Apple"); // Duplicate, ignored

System.out.println(fruits); // Output: [Apple, Banana]
🧩 What is a Map?
A collection of key-value pairs.

Each key is unique, but values can be duplicated.

Stored like: {A=1, B=2}

✅ Example:
java
Copy
Edit
Map<String, Integer> scores = new HashMap<>();
scores.put("Ali", 90);
scores.put("Sara", 85);
scores.put("Ali", 95); // Replaces previous value for key "Ali"

System.out.println(scores); // Output: {Ali=95, Sara=85}


🔍 Map vs Set – Key Differences
| Feature       | **Set**                               | **Map**                                          |
| ------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Stores        | **Only values**                       | **Key-value pairs**                              |
| Duplicates    | ❌ Not allowed                         | ✅ Values can repeat, keys can't                  |
| Access        | Only via iteration                    | Access via key (`map.get(key)`)                  |
| Example Class | `HashSet`, `LinkedHashSet`, `TreeSet` | `HashMap`, `LinkedHashMap`, `TreeMap`            |
| Null Handling | Allows one `null` value               | Allows one `null` key and multiple `null` values |


✅ Summary
| Type  | Purpose                                            |
| ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| `Set` | Collection of **unique values**                    |
| `Map` | Collection of **unique keys** mapped to **values** |



////if you want insertion order then use linkedHashMap or linkedHashSet
Map<String, Integer> map = new LinkedHashMap<>();
Set<String> set = new LinkedHashSet<>();

✅ Want insertion order?
Use these alternatives:
| Interface | Preserves Insertion Order | Class to Use    |
| --------- | ------------------------- | --------------- |
| `Map`     | ✅ Yes                     | `LinkedHashMap` |
| `Set`     | ✅ Yes                     | `LinkedHashSet` |

🧠 Summary
| Collection | Maintains Insertion Order? | Use Instead       |
| ---------- | -------------------------- | ----------------- |
| `HashMap`  | ❌ No                       | `LinkedHashMap` ✅ |
| `HashSet`  | ❌ No                       | `LinkedHashSet` ✅ |